Vacaturebeschrijving   SummaryDo you have experience in metal work or are you interested in this sector? Start as a Production Worker in Venray! You will work in a 2-shift system, earn up to € 19,45 gross per hour including shift allowance, and get plenty of opportunities to learn, grow and develop yourself within this family-owned company.
About the jobAs a Production Worker, you will work in the metal industry. You will join a small and close team where you play an important role in the production process. Do you have experience in metal work and are you motivated to learn more about this type of work? Then this could be a great opportunity for you.
Your tasks include:
- Loading and unloading metal parts in CNC machines;
- Checking products with measuring tools to ensure the correct size and quality;
- Performing simple finishing work, such as grinding and removing sharp edges;
- Reporting any problems with products, machines or the production process.

As a Production Worker you will work in a fixed 2-shift schedule from Monday to Friday. One week you work from 06:00 to 14:30 and the next week from 14:30 to 23:00. On Fridays, the working hours are different: from 06:00 to 12:30 or from 12:30 to 19:00.
What we offer- A salary of € 17,36 to € 19,45 gross per hour including shift allowance;
- Travel allowance of € 0,23 per kilometer from 10km single distance;
- 27 vacation days and 8% holiday allowance;
- Pension from your first working day;
- Working within an international company with modern production technology;
- Opportunities to develop yourself within the company and responsibility;
- The possibility of a permanent contract when performing well.

What we ask- You speak the English of German language;
- You have experience in the metal industry or a similar production environment;
- You are motivated and willing to learn.

